    "show_share": true,
    "description": "In a collaborative effort aimed at advancing educational policies in Pakistan, the Pakistan Foundational Learning Hub (PFL Hub) joined hands with the Aga Khan University Institute for Educational Development (AKU-IED) to host a policy dialogue on Foundational Learning in Pakistan. The session, held as part of the Ministry of Federal Education and Professional Training's initiatives, served as a platform to translate high-quality research into actionable policies.",
